---
---
<section class="bg-paper py-[var(--space-section)]" aria-labelledby="shared-inbox-heading">
  <div class="container-x text-center">
    <h2
      id="shared-inbox-heading"
      class="mx-auto max-w-2xl text-[length:var(--text-h2)] font-[800] leading-[var(--text-h2--line-height)] tracking-[-0.01em]"
    >
      Centralize communications with agentic shared inboxes
    </h2>
    <p class="mx-auto mt-6 max-w-3xl text-[length:var(--text-lead)] leading-relaxed text-ink-70">
      Get complete visibility into your messaging across users, teams, and channels. Heymarket
      enables you to connect with customers via business SMS, email, and top messaging apps – all
      unified in powerful shared inboxes. Take repetitive questions and scheduling off your team's
      plate with AI agents securely trained on your content.
    </p>
    <a
      href="#"
      class="group mt-7 inline-flex items-center gap-2 font-bold text-blue underline underline-offset-4"
    >
      Explore shared inboxes
      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="h-4 w-4 transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-1" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" aria-hidden="true">
        <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M5 12h14m-6-6 6 6-6 6" />
      </svg>
    </a>
  </div>

  <div class="container-x mt-12 sm:mt-16">
    <img
      src="/heymarket-website/assets/mock-shared-inbox.webp"
      alt="A shared inbox showing conversations handled by Q&A, Scheduling, and Lead Nurturing AI agents, with options to assign messages to teammates."
      width="1224"
      height="508"
      loading="lazy"
      class="mx-auto h-auto w-full max-w-[1120px]"
    />
  </div>
</section>
